{"version":1,"content":"<p>卡巴斯基創始人兼行政總裁尤金·卡巴斯基近日表示，他不認為人工智能代理會在未來幾年毀滅或接管人類，但他警告説，人工智能將帶來網絡安全方面的問題，而且這類問題如今正越來越頻繁地出現。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588182.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:04:00.121665+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T07:37:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.441624+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.441624+00:00","content_hash":"080bb8596f95a99e9302c9b29062f81f617db4fef7ab66dbf2a7eb2f533de688","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}